data: {"id": "983b4106aa82436b-thinking-parallel_evidence-156", "run_id": "983b4106aa82436b", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "从 describe 和 yaml 结果中已经可以看到关键事实：Pod 的 `Pending` 原因是 **\"missing network-attachment-definition 'unavailable-network'\"**，且 `kubectl describe` 输出中明确记载了 Multus 事件的警告：**`NoNetworkFound`** — \"cannot find a network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network) in namespace (aiops-case-05)\"。该事件重复了 60+ 次。\n\n现在需要获取更详细的 Events 来确认 Multus 报错原文和时间线。\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788782583183, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

