用了一个名为 `unavailable-network` 的 `NetworkAttachmentDefinition` 资源，但该自定义资源（CR）在 `aiops-case-05` 命名空间中并不存在。这导致 Multus 插件在初始化网络时无法找到配置定义，直接报错 `NoNetworkFound`，进而使 kubelet 无法成功创建 Pod 网络沙箱，最终导致 Pod 卡死在 `ContainerCreating` 状态。\n\n**证据支撑：**\n- **错误原文一致性**：K8s Event `fact-005f3ac6823a` 与 `fact-011d57a35376` 均明确报告了“cannot find a network-attachment-definition ... 'unavailable-network' ... not found”，排除了网络插件配置错误或运行时故障的可能性，直指资源缺失。\n- **状态匹配**：Pod 状态 `ContainerCreating` 与 `FailedCreatePodSandBox` 错误完全吻合，表明阻塞点就在容器启动前的网络准备阶段。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.3m\n├─ 问题定位: 17.0s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 47.9s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx: 47.9s (Evidence 38.3s, RCA 9.4s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 12.3s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx**: pod-sandbox-create-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 77.253, "metrics": {"run_id": "983b4106aa82436b", "mttr": {"value": "1.3m", "seconds": 77.26045513153076, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-sandbox-create-failed", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weig